{"id":"memorial_101805","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101800","label":"Data · Climate Change Report"},"label":"December 15, XX.","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101804","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101805_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_05_description","text":"I've been in hiding for a long time now."},{"id":"memorial_101805_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_05_description","text":"When I first ventured out, I saw more snow and ice on the tundra"},{"id":"memorial_101805_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_05_description","text":"than whatever I had seen in environmental journals ten years prior."},{"id":"memorial_101805_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_05_description","text":"It's just that there are no more children on their sleds anymore."},{"id":"memorial_101805_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_05_description","text":"Perhaps it was never the environment itself that I was concerned about."},{"id":"memorial_101805_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_05_description","text":"It was merely whether or not humans could survive in it."}]}